      "summary": "Unit tests for the shared cache helper and CDISCApiClient cache-key behavior, covering fresh/stale/expired cache states, refresh-failure fallback, and that raw API keys never leak into cache keys.",
      "tags": ["test", "caching", "cdisc-library"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
